stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created: tryMatch commits<br/>chat:match:{mid} + 2x user_match
    Created --> Described: saveMatchIdentities<br/>(identA/identB on the hash)
    Created --> Orphaned: match ended first<br/>→ announceMatch returns idle,<br/>NOBODY is told they matched
    Described --> Active: both sides hold `matched`
    Active --> Active: message / typing / react
    Active --> Detached: one socket drops<br/>seat held, RESUME_GRACE_SECONDS=20
    Detached --> Active: resume redeemed → partner_returned
    Detached --> Ended: grace lapses → janitorMatches ends it
    Active --> Ended: skip / leave_chat / block / disconnect(drain)
    Ended --> Retained: conversation_ended enqueued ONCE by the D6 winner
    Retained --> Deleted: retention_expires_at passes<br/>deletion worker, unless legal_hold
    Deleted --> [*]
